proTips.notes:
- RIFTBEAST stage 2, 3: Buff on your carry (for example Cinderling or Gromp or Brambleback if you find him early);
- RIFTBEAST stage 4+: Buff on Brambleback;
- push lvl 7 in stage 3-5 or 4-1 and roll for 7 Riftbeasts -> big powerspike, should be able to win whole of stage 3;
- ELDER DRAGON early -> drop Cinderling & Scuttlecrab;

- need WINSTREAK stage 2 & 3;
- good prismatic economy augment or two golden / silver augments;
- TARIC: bind with Sentinel;
- if no Ivern -> play LUX (Lunar > Fae > Primal);
- Tanks: Taric2 > Sentinel2 > Lillia2;

- BLACKTHORN: Sacrifice highest cost caster (Zyra2 > Teemo2 > Veigar2 > Zyra1) -> AP & Manareg for Azir;
- SPRYKIN: Rammus;
- if no RAMMUS3 -> Fiddlesticks3 can be your main tank;
- AZIR 3rd item can be either Rageblade (good early, not the best late game), Rabadons (best late game but need a lot of rods);
